{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"The act of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/throw#Verb\" title=\"throw\">throwing</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/something\" title=\"something\">something</a> or especially <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/someone\" title=\"someone\">someone</a> out of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/window\" title=\"window\">window</a>, especially <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/lethally\" title=\"lethally\">lethally</a>. <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt29\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt35\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/high-profile\" title=\"high-profile\">high-profile</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/removal\" title=\"removal\">removal</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/person\" title=\"person\">person</a> from an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/organization\" title=\"organization\">organization</a>.\n\n<ol><li><span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt39\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/eliminate\" title=\"eliminate\">eliminate</a> from a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/contest\" title=\"contest\">contest</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sport\" title=\"sport\">sport</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/championship\" title=\"championship\">championship</a>\n</li></ol>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt39\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/eliminate\" title=\"eliminate\">eliminate</a> from a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/contest\" title=\"contest\">contest</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sport\" title=\"sport\">sport</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/championship\" title=\"championship\">championship</a>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt41\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The act of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/remove\" title=\"remove\">removing</a> the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microsoft%20Windows\" title=\"w:Microsoft Windows\" about=\"#mwt42\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" class=\"extiw\">Microsoft Windows</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/operating_system\" title=\"operating system\">operating system</a> from a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/computer\" title=\"computer\">computer</a> in order to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/install\" title=\"install\">install</a> an alternative one."}]}],"sv":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"Swedish","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt119\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/defenestration#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">defenestration</a></span>"}]}]}